### Notes or memory

A note is pasted into **every** agent's brief; a memory (`remember`) is searched, so it costs nothing
until needed. Notes are for standing conventions; a gotcha with an error, a cause or a filename is a
memory. When in doubt, `remember`. **Say which of the two you used, and why, in a sentence.**
